    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survey the Labyrinth</strong> \u2013 A living maze where escape is your only goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Survey the Labyrinth</strong>, a dark and ever-changing maze where the walls shift and the exits vanish before your eyes. Every corridor holds secrets, every turn could lead to salvation\u2014or doom. Navigate a world filled with shifting paths, cryptic puzzles, and unseen horrors that stalk your every move. The labyrinth is alive, and it does not want you to leave. Will you find the way out, or will you become part of its endless corridors?</p>",
